He's been doing this as whole life,

1966
01:19:32.470 --> 01:19:33.857
and, you know, it's just,

1967
01:19:33.857 --> 01:19:36.360
"Okay, one wall, a little bit more challenging

1968
01:19:36.360 --> 01:19:37.193
than the last one."

1969
01:19:37.193 --> 01:19:40.980
In the same way, Laird Hamilton can surf this gigantic wave.

