01:19:40.980 --> 01:19:42.960
It doesn't happen overnight.

1971
01:19:42.960 --> 01:19:45.590
He doesn't go from a six-foot wave to a 20-foot wave.

1972
01:19:45.590 --> 01:19:48.690
He goes from a six-foot wave to a six and a half-foot wave,

1973
01:19:48.690 --> 01:19:50.960
taking these incremental little steps

1974
01:19:50.960 --> 01:19:54.900
to push that envelope of comfort or discomfort,

1975
01:19:54.900 --> 01:19:57.740
just the tiniest amount until there's an acclimation,

1976
01:19:57.740 --> 01:19:59.178
and then, you're ready for the next challenge-

1977
01:19:59.178 --> 01:20:04.178
Yeah, and it's a dishonor to our human imperfections

1978
01:20:06.480 --> 01:20:10.140
to sell the narrative that it's simply something

1979
01:20:10.140 --> 01:20:11.450
that happens in one fell swoop

1980
01:20:11.450 --> 01:20:12.283
that, you know, just happens that way-

